    <string name="about_app">Nga ha BenSuet Stay</string>
    <string name="about_body">BenSuet Stay i thusa vhatshudeni vha Afrika Tshipembe u wana vhudzulo ho tsireledzeaho na ho khwaṱhisedzwaho tsini na khamphasi yavho, na khetho dza NSFAS na dza u ḓibadela fhethu huthihi. Yo fhaṱiwa nga Mansuet Dev.</string>
    <string name="osm_attribution">Vhulapfu vhu shumisa data ya fhethu © vhashumisani vha OpenStreetMap (Nominatim).</string>
    <string name="delete_account">Phumulani akhaunthu yanga</string>
    <string name="delete_account_subtitle">Bvisani lwa tshoṱhe phrofaiḽi yaṋu na u dzhena</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_title">Phumulani akhaunthu yaṋu?</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_body">Hezwi zwi phumula lwa tshoṱhe phrofaiḽi yaṋu ya BenSuet Stay na u dzhena. Hezwi a zwi nga vhuedzedzwi murahu.</string>
    <string name="account_deleted">Akhaunthu yaṋu yo phumulwa.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">BenSuet Stay i kuvhanganya fhedzi zwine ya zwi ṱoḓa u ṱumanya vhatshudeni na vhudzulo.\n\nZwine ra zwi kuvhanganya: dzina ḽaṋu, imeiḽi, ḓiresi ya hayani, tshiimiswa na lushaka lwa thikhedzo. Musi ni tshi ita khumbelo ya rumu ri vhulunga na nomboro yaṋu ya vhuṋe ya SA, nomboro ya mutshudeni, khamphasi, zwidodombedzwa zwa mashaka a tsini na madzina a maṅwalwa e na a nanga. Kha vhaṋe vha dzinnḓu: dzina, imeiḽi na nomboro ya luṱingo.\n\nNgauri: u sumbedza vhudzulo ho teaho, u tendela vhaṋe vha dzinnḓu u shuma nga u sedza na khumbelo dzaṋu, na u ni rumela mvusuludzo nga hadzo.\n\nNdi nnyi ane a nga zwi vhona: ndi inwi fhedzi, mune wa nnḓu wa vhudzulo he na kwama, na vhalanguli vha BenSuet Stay. Milayo ya tsireledzo ya vhuvhulungelo haṋu ha data i khwaṱhisedza izwi.\n\nHune zwa vhulungwa hone: Google Firebase (Cloud Firestore, dzingu ḽa Johannesburg). Dziphasiwede dzi langulwa nga Firebase Authentication nahone a dzi vhulungwi nga app.\n\nPfanelo dzaṋu fhasi ha POPIA: ni nga sedza na u vusuludza zwidodombedzwa zwaṋu kha Nzudzanyo, nahone na phumula akhaunthu yaṋu tshifhinga tshiṅwe na tshiṅwe kha Nzudzanyo → Tshiphiri → Phumulani akhaunthu yanga. Kha zwiṅwe, shumisani Nzudzanyo → Thuso → Kwamani thikhedzo.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q1">Ndi bukha hani u sedza fhethu?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a1">Vulani ndivhadzo ni kwame Bukhani u sedza, nga murahu ni nange ḓuvha na tshifhinga. Mune wa nnḓu u a zwi khwaṱhisedza kana a zwi hana, nahone ni wana nḓivhadzo nga nḓila iṅwe na iṅwe.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q2">Ndi ita hani khumbelo ya rumu?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a2">Vulani ndivhadzo, nangani lushaka lwa rumu ni kwame Nangani rumu. Vhatshudeni vha NSFAS vha khwaṱhisedza zwidodombedzwa zwavho zwa NSFAS; vhane vha ḓibadela vha engedza zwidodombedzwa zwa mashaka a tsini na maṅwalwa avho. I tevhedzeni kha Nzudzanyo → Khumbelo dzanga.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q3">Ndi nga shumisa app hu si na inthanete naa?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a3">Ee. Ndivhadzo dze na no dzi vula dzi dzula dzi tshi vhonala, nahone khumbelo dza u sedza kana khumbelo dze na dzi ita ni si kha inthanete dzi vhulungwa kha luṱingo lwaṋu nahone dzi rumelwa nga dzoṱhe musi ni tshi ṱumana hafhu.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q4">Ndi ngani ndi sa vhoni vhudzulo hoṱhe?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a4">Siaṱari ḽa hayani ḽi thoma nga lushaka lwaṋu lwa thikhedzo na Tsini na khamphasi yanga yo vulwa. Kwamani Zwoṱhe kana Tsini na khamphasi yanga u engedza u ṱoḓa, kana ni shandukise izwi kha Nzudzanyo → Sikirini ya hayani.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q1">Ndi nnyi ane a ita na u shandukisa ndivhadzo dzanga?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a1">Tshigwada tsha vhalanguli tsha BenSuet Stay tshi ita ndivhadzo nahone tsha ni ṋea dzone. U shandukisa ndivhadzo kana zwidodombedzwa zwaṋu, shumisani Kwamani thikhedzo, kana Humbelani tshanduko fhasi ha Mafhungo a muthu.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q2">Ndi shuma hani nga khumbelo dza u sedza?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a2">Vulani Dzibukhu ni khwaṱhisedze kana ni hane khumbelo iṅwe na iṅwe. Musi ni tshi hana, ṋekani tshiitisi ni themendele tshiṅwe tshifhinga. Mutshudeni u ḓivhadzwa nga u ṱavhanya.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q3">Hu itea mini musi ndi tshi tendela khumbelo?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a3">Fhethu huthihi hu bviswa kha lushaka ulwo lwa rumu nga huṱhe, nahone mutshudeni u vhona tshiṅwalwa tshaṋu kha Khumbelo dzanga.</string>
</resources>
